Discord](https://www.spigotmc.org/link-forums/discord.95/)\n  * [Hub](https://www.spigotmc.org/link-forums/hub.75/)\n  * [Issues](https://www.spigotmc.org/link-forums/issues.14/)\n  * [Members](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/) [](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/)\n    * [Notable Members](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/)\n    * [Current Visitors](https://www.spigotmc.org/online/)\n    * [Recent Activity](https://www.spigotmc.org/recent-activity/)\n    * [New Profile Posts](https://www.spigotmc.org/find-new/profile-posts)\n  * [Donate](https://www.spigotmc.org/pages/donate/)\n\n\n[](https://www.spigotmc.org/) \n\nYour username or email address:\n     \n\nPassword:\n    \n[Forgot your password?](https://www.spigotmc.org/lost-password/)      Stay logged in\n[](https://www.spigotmc.org/)\n  * [ Menu ](https://www.spigotmc.org/)\n  * [Wiki](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/) [](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/)\n  * [Members](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/) [](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/)\n\n\n**SpigotMC - High Performance Minecraft Software**\n[Home](https://www.spigotmc.org/) [Wiki](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/) [BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord/)\n# BungeeCord Plugin Development\n[](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/) May 22, 2022\n  * [Page](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-plugin-development/#wikiContent)\n  * [History](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-plugin-development/#history)\n  * [Editors](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-plugin-development/#editors)\n\n\n  * BungeeCord Plugin Development\nA list of helpful links for BungeeCord plugin development\n* * *\n**Guides**  \n\n    * [Creating your first BungeeCord plugin with Maven (Proxy)](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/create-your-first-bungeecord-plugin-proxy-spigotmc/)\n    * [Creating your first BungeeCord plugin with Gradle](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/create-your-first-bungeecord-plugin-with-gradle)  \n\n    * [Event API Tutorial](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/event-api/)\n    * [Common Pitfalls](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/common-development-pitfalls-bungeecord/)\n    * [Creating basic command functions (Proxy)](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/creating-basic-command-functions-in-bungeecord/)\n    * [Bukkit & BungeeCord Plugin Messaging Channel](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bukkit-bungee-plugin-messaging-channel/)\n    * [The Chat Component API](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/the-chat-component-api/)\n    * [Sending players between servers (Proxy)](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/sending-players-between-servers-in-bungeecord/)\n    * [Using The BungeeCord Configuration System](http://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/using-the-bungee-configuration-system/)\n    * [Creating a scoreboard via BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/scoreboard-not-api/?noRedirect=1)\n**Resources**  \n\n    * [BungeeCord API (GitHub)](https://github.com/SpigotMC/BungeeCord/tree/master/api)\n    * [BungeeCord API (JavaDoc)](https://ci.md-5.net/job/BungeeCord/ws/api/target/apidocs/index.html)\n    * [BungeeCord API (Chat JavaDoc)](http://ci.md-5.net/job/BungeeCord/ws/chat/target/apidocs/overview-summary.html)\n  * Loading...\n  * Loading...\n\n\n(220609 Views) \nLast Modified: May 22, 2022 at 8:48 AM \n[XenCarta PRO](http://xenforo.com/community/resources/1690/) © Jason Axelrod from [8WAYRUN.COM](http://8wayrun.com/)\n### Sponsors\n[ ![Minecraft Server List](https://static.spigotmc.org/img/minecraft-server-list.png) ](https://minecraft-server-list.com/ \"Looking for a server to play Minecraft on or to extend your servers playerbase? Minecraft Server List is an extensive list of Minecraft servers from around the world. Submit your server, let your players vote for it and gain even more players forward.\") [ ![Aternos](https://static.spigotmc.org/img/aternos.png) ](https://www.spigotmc.org/go/aternos \"Minecraft servers. Free. Forever.\") [ ![Tebex Donation Plugin & Webstore](https://static.spigotmc.org/img/tebex.png) ](https://www.spigotmc.org/go/tebex \"Struggling to cover the costs of your Minecraft Server? Setup your\nown webstore with Tebex in under 30 seconds.\")\n[Sign up now!](https://www.spigotmc.org/register/)\n### Wiki Navigation\n  * [BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord/)\n  * [About BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/about-bungeecord/)\n  * [BungeeCord Commands](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-commands/)\n  * [BungeeCord Configuration Guide](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-configuration-guide/)\n  * [BungeeCord FAQ](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-faq/)\n  * [BungeeCord Installation](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-installation/)\n  * [BungeeCord Maven](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-maven/)\n  * [BungeeCord Modules](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord-modules/)\n  * **BungeeCord Plugin Development**\n  * [Bukkit & BungeeCord Plugin Messaging Channel](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bukkit-bungee-plugin-messaging-channel/)\n  * [Common Development Pitfalls](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/common-development-pitfalls-bungeecord/)\n  * [Create your first BungeeCord plugin (Proxy)](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/create-your-first-bungeecord-plugin-proxy-spigotmc/)\n  * [Create your first BungeeCord plugin with Gradle](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/create-your-first-bungeecord-plugin-with-gradle/)\n  * [Creating a plugin of Bungee(without Maven)](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/creating-a-plugin-of-bungee-without-maven/)\n  * [Event API](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/event-api/)\n  * [Scoreboard (Not API)](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/scoreboard-not-api/)\n  * [Sending a custom plugin message from BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/sending-a-custom-plugin-message-from-bungeecord/)\n  * [Sending players between servers in BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/sending-players-between-servers-in-bungeecord/)\n  * [The Chat Component API](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/the-chat-component-api/)\n  * [The Chat Component API (German)](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/the-chat-component-api-german/)\n  * [Using the Bungee Configuration System](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/using-the-bungee-configuration-system/)\n  * [Creating basic command functions in BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/creating-basic-command-functions-in-bungeecord/)\n\n\n### [Wiki Index](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/)\n  * [BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord/)\n  * [Forums](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/forums/)\n  * [Spigot](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot/)\n\n\n### Top Editors \n\n[Mineplugins](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/mineplugins.173014/)\n    386 \n\n[smmmadden](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/smmmadden.104514/)\n    375 \n\n[Jeppa](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/jeppa.50435/)\n    373 \n\n[RockinChaos](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/rockinchaos.3051/)\n    343 \n\n[Maximvdw](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/maximvdw.6687/)\n    325 \n\n[Blackixx](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/blackixx.649/)\n    235 \n\n[Indyuce](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/indyuce.253965/)\n    230 \n\n[BrettPlays](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/brettplays.80037/)\n    205 \n\n[Phoenix616](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/phoenix616.3651/)\n    191 \n\n[Zrips](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/zrips.24572/)\n    179\n### Wiki Statistics \n\nPages:\n    1,407 \n\nEdits:\n    13,453 \n\nLikes:\n    0 \n\nViews:\n    39,877,343 \n\nAttached Files:\n    13 (318.6 KB)\n**SpigotMC - High Performance Minecraft Software**\n[Home](https://www.spigotmc.org/) [Wiki](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/) [BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord/) \n\nStyle\n\n  * [FAQ](https://www.spigotmc.org/threads/311785/)\n  * [Contact Us](https://www.spigotmc.org/threads/contact-us.321793/)\n  * [Terms](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-terms/)\n  * [Rules](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-rules/)\n  * [Privacy Policy](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-privacy/)\n\n\n  * [](https://www.spigotmc.org/threads/contact-us.32